  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving access to quality, inclusive and comprehensive eye health services for marginalised rural communities in central region Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to improve availability, quality and accessibility of eye health services in Primary Health Centres, District Hospitals and surgical outreach camps so that people in marginalized rural communities can access these services.</narrative>
  </description>
